AUDIO: 'The main job of an AI creative technologist is to&nbsp;&nbsp; design and implement AI powered&nbsp; content pipelines. In this video,&nbsp;&nbsp; I\'ll show you how to build a simple but powerful&nbsp; pipeline using Claude Code and fal. Let\'s go. Here\'s an overview of what we\'ll be covering.&nbsp; First is setup with Claude Code and fal MCP.&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Second is pre-production where we cover Claude&nbsp; artifacts and skills. Third is production where&nbsp;&nbsp; we\'ll generate the final videos. This&nbsp; workflow requires Claude Code desktop,&nbsp;&nbsp; a fal account and fal api key. Now make a new&nbsp; folder on your desktop called film workflow.&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:32] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Open cloud code and set that new folder as&nbsp; your project folder. Next, we\'ll connect the&nbsp;&nbsp; fal MCP in cloud code. Add the fal MCP server and&nbsp; paste in your fal API key. Once it\'s connected,&nbsp;&nbsp; Claude can generate images, audio, and video&nbsp; directly. No browser tabs required. Two quick tips&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'for Claude code. At the bottom, set approvals to&nbsp; auto. This will stop Claude asking for permission&nbsp;&nbsp; at every little step. Second tip, try voice&nbsp; mode. You click on the microphone button,&nbsp;&nbsp; then speak. Claude will turn this into text&nbsp; and then you can review and hit enter. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[01:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'let\'s set which models we want to use. Prompt.&nbsp; For images, use Nano Banana Light. And for video,&nbsp;&nbsp; use Seed Dance 2 text to video. Nano Banana&nbsp; Light is incredibly fast with high quality. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp; let\'s do some casting prompt. Create four images&nbsp; of a Korean man in his 20s in a hoodie full body&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[01:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and create a website displaying them each numbered&nbsp; for review. Call it our casting page. This website&nbsp;&nbsp; is called a clawed artifact and it\'s what makes&nbsp; this workflow so powerful. We like character 2&nbsp;&nbsp; and we prompt make four more images where&nbsp; character 2 has dark round framed glasses.'

[01:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Artifacts are usually deleted. So we prompt save&nbsp; this website to the project. Now we can refer to&nbsp;&nbsp; our favorite character by number anywhere in&nbsp; the project. Now let\'s make a Claude skill to&nbsp;&nbsp;'

